# --- Corpus source bytes -------------------------------------------------
# The ORIGINAL downloaded CAQM PDFs are evidence. They are intentionally
# committed so `make verify` is reproducible on a judge's clean machine.
# Only scratch artefacts are ignored.
corpus/sources/.tamper-scratch/
corpus/sources/**/*.partial

